  "verdict": "Yes \u2014 the Water & Sewer utility pays for itself. In both FY2024 and FY2025, operating revenues (mainly metered water sales and sewage disposal charges) exceeded operating expenditures, leaving an operating margin of $968,516 in FY2024 and $1,314,304 in FY2025. Transfers were small relative to operations (in: $287,438; out: $0 in FY2025). The utility is not being subsidized by the General Fund, nor is it subsidizing other city operations at a material scale.",
